      "writtenOn": "2023-10-17T14:31:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please look at my reply to Handa below. I understand this is a little bit of legwork, but in the end it\u0027s 10~15 lines of code ; there is a strong stance in Android against providing \"convenience\" APIs (that\u0027s the job of Jetpack), and here it sounds very ad-hoc (e.g. why only the LinkProperties and not the NetworkCapabilities ?) and expensive if not used (LinkProperties are pretty expensive to marshall).\n\nPlease first look at the code I wrote below – I don\u0027t think doing the below is all that much to ask for this use case. Then let\u0027s discuss more in our next meeting and see whether we think this is still necessary, or if we can find other alternatives. If we really think we should send the LP it shouldn\u0027t be too hard to do.",
      "parentUuid": "2d19187e_a5c10e2c",
      "revId": "e5f717ed571c31b05fcf7b9285fadc78b184680e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
