        "id": 2016993
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-18T02:33:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks good overall except two concerns:\n\n- Is the `registerNetworkCallback` guaranteed to return the same network as the upstream selector does given the same NetworkRequest?\n- It seems Networks are equal iff net IDs are equal. I wonder if Ethernet/WiFi\u0027s net ID would be recycled? If so it could be tricky to maintain the mapping.\n\nAlso, some order handling is required from our side: besides the above code we need to handle the case where the network callback comes later than `onLocalNetworkInfoChanged`.",
      "parentUuid": "e6d42f8f_2b401f48",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 43,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 46,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "e5f717ed571c31b05fcf7b9285fadc78b184680e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ff0926c7_64f15313",
        "filename": "framework/src/android/net/LocalNetworkInfo.java",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 46,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-18T04:06:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "registerNetworkCallback will send you callbacks about all networks that match the request. You can\u0027t pin it to only one network, but you\u0027re guaranteed to see all that match the request, so if the request is the same you\u0027re guaranteed to see the upstream.\n\nNetwork IDs are not recycled.\n\nYes, you do need to be prepared for both orders. This is relatively easy to do as you can simply have a single function that is called in `onLinkPropertiesChanged` and `onLost` for this callback as well as `onLocalNetworkInfoChanged` for the local network. You need to do this regardless because in principle the iface name for the upstream can change dynamically.",
      "parentUuid": "7acf31e0_88f8cf47",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 43,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 46,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "e5f717ed571c31b05fcf7b9285fadc78b184680e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
